<h1>Linux User Net — archive</h1>

<p>Past years of the weekly link list. The current year lives at
<a href="/lun/">/lun/</a>. The archive is a record of what was covered —
links are left as they were read, even when they have since rotted.</p>

<p>The net's history runs deeper than this archive:
<a href="https://www.kc7nyr.com/">kc7nyr.com</a> (Mark, KC7NYR) carries
the list back to early 2022, and
<a href="https://kc7mm.com/wiki/doku.php?id=linuxusernet:linuxnews">kc7mm.com</a>
(Russ, KC7MM) the years after. The net itself is older still — its
earliest stewards kept it from around 2016, and if their records
survive somewhere, I'd love to know.</p>

